{"format":1,"manifest":{"name":"reasonml","publisher":"vyloxi","version":"1.0.0","displayName":"ReasonML","description":"Syntax coloring, comment toggling and snippets for ReasonML (.re .rei).","engines":{"ferrum":"^0.1.0"},"categories":["Languages"],"icon":"icon.png","repository":"https://github.com/voukengdongmofrankysteve/ferrum-market","license":"MIT","contributes":{"languages":[{"id":"reasonml","name":"ReasonML","extensions":[".re",".rei"],"grammar":"grammars/reasonml.json","lineComment":"//","blockComment":["/*","*/"]}],"snippets":[{"language":"ReasonML","path":"snippets/reasonml.json"}]}},"files":{"icon.png":{"encoding":"base64","content":""},"grammars/reasonml.json":{"encoding":"utf8","content":"{\n  \"ignoreCase\": false,\n  \"rules\": [\n    {\n      \"begin\": \"\\\\/\\\\*\",\n      \"end\": \"\\\\*\\\\/\",\n      \"token\": \"comment\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"\\\\/\\\\/.*$\",\n      \"token\": \"comment\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"\\\"(?:[^\\\"\\\\\\\\]|\\\\\\\\.)*\\\"\",\n      \"token\": \"string\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"'(?:[^'\\\\\\\\]|\\\\\\\\.)*'\",\n      \"token\": \"string\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"\\\\[@@?[^\\\\]]*\\\\]|\\\\[%[^\\\\]]*\\\\]\",\n      \"token\": \"macro\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"=>|->|\\\\|>|::\",\n      \"token\": \"keyword\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"\\\\b(?:0[xX][0-9a-fA-F_]+|0[bB][01_]+|0[oO][0-7_]+|\\\\d[\\\\d_]*(?:\\\\.\\\\d[\\\\d_]*)?(?:[eE][+-]?\\\\d+)?)[uUlLfFdDnNiI]{0,3}\\\\b\",\n      \"token\": \"number\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"\\\\b(?:initializer|constraint|exception|external|function|functor|include|inherit|mutable|private|virtual|assert|downto|switch|method|module|nonrec|object|struct|begin|class|match|while|done|else|lazy|open|then|type|when|with|and|end|for|fun|let|new|rec|sig|try|val|as|do|if|in|of|or|to)\\\\b\",\n      \"token\": \"keyword\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"\\\\b(?:false|true)\\\\b\",\n      \"token\": \"constant\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"\\\\b(?:string|option|float|array|bool|list|unit|char|int|ref)\\\\b\",\n      \"token\": \"type\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"\\\\b(?:print_endline|Belt\\\\.List\\\\.map|Js\\\\.log)\\\\b\",\n      \"token\": \"function\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"\\\\b[A-Z][A-Za-z0-9_]*\\\\b\",\n      \"token\": \"type\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"\\\\b[A-Za-z_][A-Za-z0-9_]*(?=\\\\s*\\\\()\",\n      \"token\": \"function\"\n    }\n  ]\n}\n"},"snippets/reasonml.json":{"encoding":"utf8","content":"{\n  \"Let binding\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"let\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"let ${1:name} = (${2:x}) => {\",\n      \"  $0\",\n      \"};\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"A function\"\n  },\n  \"Switch\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"switch\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"switch (${1:value}) {\",\n      \"| ${2:pattern} => $0\",\n      \"};\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"switch\"\n  },\n  \"Type\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"type\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"type ${1:t} =\",\n      \"  | ${2:A}\",\n      \"  | ${3:B};\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"A variant type\"\n  }\n}\n"},"README.md":{"encoding":"utf8","content":"# ReasonML\n\nSyntax coloring, comment toggling and snippets for ReasonML.\n\n## Files\n\n`.re`, `.rei`\n\n## Features\n\n- Colors keywords, types, strings, numbers, comments and more. The colors follow your theme.\n- **Toggle Line Comment** (Ctrl+/) uses `//`.\n- 3 snippets.\n\n## Snippets\n\nType the prefix and press Tab.\n\n| Prefix | What it inserts |\n| --- | --- |\n| `let` | A function |\n| `switch` | switch |\n| `type` | A variant type |\n\nThis extension runs no code and asks for no permissions. It is built with the [language contribution](https://ferrum.vyloxi.com/docs/languages) format.\n"}}}